.TH DT-MEDIAINFO 1 "August 2026" "dirtoo tools" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
dt-mediainfo \- print media metadata for files
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dt-mediainfo
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.I PATH\fR...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Probe image/video/audio files and print metadata such as dimensions,
duration, and framerate (via the dirtoo media probe / ffprobe integration).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
.TQ
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR dirtoo (1),
.BR dt-copy (1),
.BR dt-move (1),
.BR dt-rename (1),
.BR dt-rm (1),
.BR dt-mkdir (1),
.BR dt-filter (1)
